---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Components">
  <h1>Components</h1>
  <p>
    One page per component lives in <code>src/pages/components/&lt;component&gt;.astro</code>. The
    first set lands in milestone M4.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/components/primitives/">Primitives</a>: surface, icon, state layer, focus ring</li>
    <li><a href="/components/button/">Button</a>: variants, sizes, shapes, toggle buttons</li>
    <li><a href="/components/icon-button/">Icon button</a>: variants, sizes, widths, toggles</li>
    <li><a href="/components/card/">Card</a>: filled, elevated, outlined; interactive cards</li>
    <li><a href="/components/divider/">Divider</a>: horizontal, inset, vertical</li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/loading-indicator/">Loading indicator</a>: indeterminate, determinate,
      contained
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/navigation-bar/">Navigation bar</a>: short navigation bar; legacy bar
      (deprecated)
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/navigation-rail/">Navigation rail</a>: wide navigation rail; legacy rail
      (deprecated)
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/navigation-drawer/">Navigation drawer</a>: permanent, dismissible and
      modal drawers; headlines, badges, dividers
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/navigation-suite/">Navigation suite</a>: bar, rail or expanded rail by
      window size class; drawer override, show / hide
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/canonical-layouts/">Canonical layouts</a>: list-detail, supporting pane,
      feed; panes by the layout's own width, navigation, drag handle
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/tabs/">Tabs</a>: primary, secondary; fixed, scrollable; text, icon,
      icon and text, leading icon
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/top-app-bar/">Top app bar</a>: small, center-aligned, medium / large flexible,
      two-rows; pinned, enter-always and exit-until-collapsed scrolling
    </li>
    <li><a href="/components/assist-chip/">Assist chip</a>: flat, elevated, icons, disabled</li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/chips/">Chips</a>: filter, input and suggestion chips; flat, elevated,
      expressive; chip sets
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/fab/">FAB</a>: sizes, color styles, extended FAB; small FAB (deprecated)
    </li>
    <li><a href="/components/fab-menu/">FAB menu</a>: toggle FAB, staggered items, color sets</li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/menus/">Menus</a>: standard, vibrant, segmented, baseline; checkable,
      selectable, submenus
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/button-group/">Button group</a>: standard, connected; selection,
      overflow menu
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/split-button/">Split button</a>: variants, sizes XS–XL, trailing menu
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/floating-toolbar/">Floating toolbar</a>: horizontal, vertical, with FAB;
      expand/collapse, exit on scroll
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/docked-toolbar/">Docked toolbar</a>: spread, center, space around/evenly;
      exit on scroll; bottom app bar (deprecated)
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/progress/">Progress indicators</a>: linear, circular; flat, wavy;
      determinate, indeterminate
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/search/">Search</a>: search bar; full-screen, contained, docked and
      docked-with-gap views; AppBarWithSearch
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/checkbox/">Checkbox</a>: unchecked, checked, indeterminate; error,
      disabled; tri-state parent
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/radio-button/">Radio button</a>: selected, unselected, disabled; radio
      groups, vertical and horizontal
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/switch/">Switch</a>: checked, unchecked, disabled; icons in the handle;
      press and toggle motion
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/slider/">Slider</a>: standard, range, centered, vertical; sizes XS–XL;
      stops, inset icon, value indicator
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/text-field/">Text fields</a>: filled, outlined; label float with no
      JavaScript; icons, prefix / suffix, supporting text, counter, error, multi-line
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/time-picker/">Time pickers</a>: dial (12 / 24-hour, vibrant,
      horizontal), time input (uncontained with the side column), scroll wheels; the dialogs
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/list/">Lists</a>: one to three lines, segmented, interactive selection
      (listbox, checkbox / radio / switch indicators), dragged; legacy list item (deprecated)
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/tooltip/">Tooltips</a>: plain, rich (subhead, action), caret; hover,
      focus and long press
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/badge/">Badges</a>: small (dot), large with a count up to 999+; on an
      icon (badged box)
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/dialog/">Dialogs</a>: alert (icon, stacked buttons, scrolling text),
      custom content, full-screen; native modal dialog
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/snackbar/">Snackbar</a>: text, action, dismiss with its tooltip, action
      on a new line; a host that shows one at a time
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/bottom-sheet/">Bottom sheets</a>: modal (partially expanded, expanded),
      standard with a peek height; drags, the drag handle with its tooltip
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/side-sheet/">Side sheets</a>: standard (pushes the content), modal,
      detached, adaptive at 600dp; header with back and close buttons, actions
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/carousel/">Carousel</a>: multi-browse, uncontained, hero, center-aligned
      hero (Compose's keylines and masks), full screen; native snapping, arrow keys
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/pull-to-refresh/">Pull to refresh</a>: Compose's arrow indicator or the
      loading indicator; touch and pen pulls, a Refresh button for the keyboard
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/components/segmented-button/">Segmented button</a>: single and multiple choice on
      native radios / checkboxes (deprecated: use the connected button group)
    </li>
  </ul>
</Base>
